WEBVTT

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:19.160
SELECT THE DESIRED TRANSACTION

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:34.260
BANK

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.130
DIE BEASTMEN!

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:13.840
<i>Ten years since the establishment</i>
<i>of the Beastmen District,</i>

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:16.630
<i>opposition to beastmen's</i>
<i>self-government remains strong,</i>

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:19.180
<i>as seen in the anti-beastmen demonstration</i>
<i>at the Diet Building.</i>

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:21.090
OVER 30,000 ATTEND
ANTI-BEASTMEN DEMONSTRATION

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:24.140
<i>The bus is now departing.</i>

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:27.600
<i>If you're standing,</i>
<i>please hold onto a strap or handrail.</i>

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.560
CHUO WHARF

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.020
SYLVASTA PHARMACEUTICAL

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:18.230
<i>Since the enactment of the Special</i>
<i>Beastmen Administrative District Act,</i>

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:19.360
<i>Anima-City has been</i>

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:24.160
<i>developed as a place where beastmen</i>
<i>can live their lives like beastmen.</i>

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:28.240
That's it!

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:33.170
<i>We're assisting with the development</i>
<i>of the Beastmen District.</i>

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.340
<i>Sylvasta Pharmaceutical.</i>

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.100
Damn!

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:37.610
You beastman scum!

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:40.820
We know what you're trying to do.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.570
All you scum escaping to Anima-City
pass through here.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.120
Patrolling here
is like shooting fish in a barrel.

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:50.240
Any more of you freaks come around here,

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.410
and I'll puke!

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:53.960
Fuck off and die!

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.380
Excuse me!

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:02.260
Why don't you put those down?

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:06.050
She's a very important guest of ours.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.140
Please treat her with kindness.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:15.730
Firing an arrow at me, huh?

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:20.650
Don't you think that's rude?

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:27.990
Let's teach these punks a lesson.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.700
Killing them always causes
a lot of trouble later,

00:05:33.790 --> 00:05:35.080
so go easy on them.

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:53.560
The roads to Anima-City are blocked
by beastman hunter scumbags.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:57.560
But don't worry. I'll help you.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.520
Who are you?

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:05.570
A compassionate volunteer who extends
a helping hand to beastmen in trouble,

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.400
Marie Itami.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:10.570
You seem suspicious.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.700
Oh, I'm hurt.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.160
So how much is this going to cost?

00:06:15.240 --> 00:06:17.500
I told you, I'm a volunteer.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:20.210
You're the type
that will come for payment later.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:22.380
Well, you sure are a cynic.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:25.000
Being a cynic is
what's gotten me this far.

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:26.460
You're right about that.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:29.180
Fine, I'll take every penny you've got.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:30.510
Seriously?

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.060
It's the price for your life, you know.

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:38.100
Don't place so little value on it.
You know it's true.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:41.310
Quit acting like you're doing me a favor.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:49.360
ANIMARU

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:02.420
Are there really only beastmen
in that city?

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.670
That's right. That's Anima-City.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.550
You're escaping trouble too?

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.190
Don't worry.

00:07:22.100 --> 00:07:24.440
Now, you'll be able to sleep in peace.

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:32.320
Okay, we're here.

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:35.910
Once you're off this boat,
we don't know each other. Got it?

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.120
Got it. Thanks.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:08.230
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:10.070
<i>Why is it so quiet?</i>

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.630
It's a festival!

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:18.720
It's the mayor!

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:21.220
-It's Mayor Rosé!
-It's the mayor!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.140
Long live the mayor!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:25.350
<i>Ten years after the establishment</i>
<i>of Anima-City,</i>

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:29.110
<i>the gap between beastmen</i>
<i>and humans still exists.</i>

00:09:29.770 --> 00:09:34.320
<i>But this city remains a refuge</i>
<i>for beastmen.</i>

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:36.400
<i>To rejoice the last ten years</i>

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:40.450
<i>as well as the next ten years</i>
<i>and far into the future,</i>

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:43.620
<i>let's celebrate the city's anniversary!</i>

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:51.670
Everyone really is a beastman!

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:55.590
I don't have to run anymore!

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:23.870
I'm sorry.

00:10:30.330 --> 00:10:31.920
What a fine smell.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:35.550
The smell of beastmen
filled with delight and joy.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:41.970
Enjoy this beastmen celebration
we've waited 1,000 years for.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.470
I guess it takes all kinds.

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.020
Why is he crying?

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:49.480
It's kind of creepy.

00:10:55.320 --> 00:10:56.360
That's weird.

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:08.040
Mayor, there's a call
from Prime Minister Shiramizu.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:12.580
<i>Mayor Rosé, congratulations</i>
<i>on reaching ten years.</i>

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:16.000
It's all thanks to your understanding,
Prime Minister.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.920
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:22.590
The Beastman District isn't set in stone.

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:25.760
If you beastmen
ever do anything dangerous,

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:29.060
who knows what might happen to it?

00:11:32.980 --> 00:11:34.860
<i>I'm counting on your cooperation.</i>

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:42.450
As usual, I can't tell
if he's congratulating or threatening us.

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.950
But still, ten years have passed.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.620
To the ten years
of Barballet Rosé's bitter struggles.

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:54.170
To the next ten years of Anima-City.

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:11.600
This really hits the spot!

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:15.600
What's this? Bought some snacks, huh?
I knew you were hiding something.

00:12:16.440 --> 00:12:17.570
It's the weasel!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:19.780
I'm no weasel! I'm a mink!

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:20.780
Really?

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:24.240
I'm nothing like those rascals
in their cheap fur.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.280
I told you to give me every last penny.

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.120
You sure can't trust youngsters
these days.

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:33.080
I'm not paying a cent more!

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:35.750
After getting off the boat,
we're strangers, right?

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:38.710
Do I look like a woman
who would stoop to that level?

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:41.800
You're breaking my heart!

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:46.010
Hey! Thief!

00:12:46.430 --> 00:12:48.140
Oh, you poor thing.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:52.640
Be careful. You'll get fleeced
in no time here in Anima-City.

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.390
I bet you're in cahoots!

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:56.900
That pickpocket is getting away, you know.

00:13:00.400 --> 00:13:04.110
Help! Someone,
please stop that pickpocket!

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:13.750
Stop!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:31.890
Where did he go?

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:36.350
Damn it!

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:04.800
Watch out!

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:08.800
Hurry up, old man!

00:14:11.350 --> 00:14:14.640
Holy crap! Holy freaking crap!

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:26.190
That hurt!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.820
It's the guy who was crying!

00:14:33.240 --> 00:14:34.700
Wait. He's crying again.

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:41.330
Was it you
who ruined the beastmen's celebration?

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:42.960
It wasn't me!

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.130
All I did was hit a pillar!

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:46.920
Why would it blow up from that?

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:48.470
Obviously, it wouldn't!

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:50.260
I told you, it wasn't me!

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:54.430
<i>There was a guy...</i>

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:57.560
fiddling around by the pillars.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:58.850
A guy?

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:38.970
It appears I made a mistake. My apologies.

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.400
What the heck is with that guy?

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:50.900
Oh, that's right! The pickpocket!

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:13.050
What's going on?

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:18.350
Tough luck, pal. That bomb had no smell.

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:20.850
Even a beastman wouldn't notice it.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:26.270
What the hell's going on?

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.700
That hurt.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.910
What is this guy? Are you immortal?

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:43.870
Out with it.
Why did you disrupt the festival?

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:02.810
Damn, he's pretty nimble.

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:06.730
What happened, Sato?
Did you botch your trap?

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:11.690
Watch out for that wolf bastard.
He even survived my explosion!

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:14.820
These guys appear to be pros.

00:17:30.090 --> 00:17:31.090
I see now!

00:17:31.710 --> 00:17:33.090
Humans!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:40.300
You've sold out to humans, haven't you?

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:43.310
How did you know?

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:49.310
You can't erase the stench of humans
that's soaked into you.

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:52.320
You've got a hell of a nose!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:56.200
You've sold out
to the anti-beastmen faction.

00:17:57.990 --> 00:18:00.410
Don't you call me a sellout!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.870
Whether they're beastmen
or humans doesn't matter.

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:05.370
Any job I take,

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:08.750
I do it right!

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.670
That's what it's all about!

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:16.010
You call that a reason
for spoiling the festival?

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:18.340
Bullshit!

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:26.020
You'll pay for your crimes
with your lives.

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:39.990
You scumbag sellouts
who sold your beastman souls to humans...

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:45.290
You're not even worth
using these claws of mine on.

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:48.250
My fists are good enough for you!

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:51.420
Bring it on!

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.920
You'll regret it!

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:19.320
Let go!

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:22.700
Since you've lost your pride
in being a beastman,

00:19:22.780 --> 00:19:25.240
you won't need your deer pride either!

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:26.540
Don't! Please don't!

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:29.830
Not my antlers! Anything but my antlers!

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:35.590
It's curtains for you now, cub!

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.340
You think I'm a cub, huh?

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:57.940
Don't move!

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:01.740
Make a move and this brat dies!

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:06.240
Who did you say would die?

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:13.210
Cut that out!

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:14.920
That's cruel!

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:26.850
That's enough, isn't it?
Have some pity on them!

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:30.810
Don't stop me.
These bastards disrupted the festival.

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:33.480
But they're beastmen like you!

00:20:34.020 --> 00:20:35.060
How can you do this?

00:20:35.520 --> 00:20:37.560
These scum were hired by humans.

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:40.280
They're a disgrace to all beastmen.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:42.900
This is what they deserve.

00:20:44.450 --> 00:20:45.780
Cut it out!

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.200
I told you to cut it out!

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:05.800
That's enough!

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:09.300
Why are beastmen fighting
among themselves?

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:12.100
Isn't this city a paradise for beastmen?

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:17.350
That's exactly why I do this.

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:19.900
Humans are the enemies of this city.

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:22.940
Beastmen hired by humans
are the same as them.

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:25.400
Not all humans are like that!

00:21:26.700 --> 00:21:28.450
All humans are the same.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.370
No, they're not!

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:32.290
You see,

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:35.580
I'm a human too!

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:38.830
<i>That's right.</i>

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.710
<i>I'm a human.</i>

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:45.920
I was a human!

00:21:49.140 --> 00:21:50.350
Looking like that?

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:50.490
Subtitle translation by Brian Athey
